===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|belâzen}}, from {{inh|de|goh|bilâzan}}. Equivalent to {{prefix|de|be|lassen}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/bəˈlasn̩/|/bəˈlasən/}}
* {{audio|de|De-belassen.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|de|be|las|sen}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|belassen<belässt#beließ,belassen>}}

# to [[leave]] something as it is
#: {{uxi|de|Belassen wir es dabei.|Let's leave it at that.}}

